{"displayStem":"샅고랑인대 바로 아래 넙다리삼각의 횡단 모식도다. 둘레 선은 넙다리집이며 A·V는 동맥·정맥이다. 그림의 왼쪽이 가쪽이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"독립 제작 모식도 · 크기 비례 아님","links":[]}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C01 c01-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"구조 관계를 단순화한 교육용 모식도\"><rect width=\"800\" height=\"470\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"45\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">가쪽</text><text x=\"660\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">안쪽</text><ellipse cx=\"465\" cy=\"220\" rx=\"230\" ry=\"110\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"340\" cy=\"220\" rx=\"50\" ry=\"50\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"329\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">A</text><ellipse cx=\"500\" cy=\"220\" rx=\"65\" ry=\"55\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"489\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">V</text><line x1=\"590\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"320\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"></line><text x=\"605\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">관</text><ellipse cx=\"125\" cy=\"220\" rx=\"40\" ry=\"35\" stroke=\"#111\" fill=\"white\" stroke-width=\"2\"></ellipse><text x=\"115\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"25\" style=\"font-size:25px\" fill=\"#111\">X</text><text x=\"260\" y=\"385\" font-size=\"28\" style=\"font-size:28px\" fill=\"#111\">둘레 선: 넙다리집 경계</text></svg></div></div>"]}